Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.10,0:50:46.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.24,0:50:50.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to give Yeah, you're going to be born inside these inside these platforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.87,0:50:52.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pretty amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.51,0:50:55.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we're so happy that we're working with these these industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.91,0:51:00.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as we've integrated NVIDIA into Palantir and ServiceNow,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.11,0:51:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're integrating NVIDIA into the most computationally intensive simulation industries, Synopsys and Cadence.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.16,0:51:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today we're announcing that Siemens is also doing the same thing.
