Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.19,0:51:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to have agentic chip designers and system designers working with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.73,0:51:42.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,helping us do design just as we have agentic software engineers helping our software engineers code today.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.94,0:51:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we'll have agentic chip designers and system designers.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.52,0:51:49.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to create you inside this.
