Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.60,0:52:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to design the manufacturing lines that assemble all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.48,0:52:08.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And these manufacturing plants are going to be essentially gigantic robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.08,0:52:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.64,0:52:11.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.64,0:52:12.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.64,0:52:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, you're going to be designed in a computer.
