Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.49,0:52:58.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,now the industry the industry that made NVIDIA possible where I'm just so happy that the now the technology
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.83,0:53:05.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,that we're creating is at a level of sophistication and capability that we can now help them revolutionize their industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.68,0:53:12.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, what started with with with them, we now have the opportunity to go back and and help them revolutionize theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.70,0:53:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at the stuff that we're going to do with Siemens.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.68,0:53:18.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.52,0:53:26.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Breakthroughs in physical AI are letting AI move from screens to our physical world.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.84,0:53:36.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And just in time as the world builds factories of every kind for chips, computers, life-saving drugs, and AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.20,0:53:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,As the global labor shortage worsens, we need automation powered by physical AI and robotics more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.64,0:53:53.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This, where AI meets the world's largest physical industries, is the foundation of NVIDIA and Siemens partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.32,0:53:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,For nearly two centuries, Siemens has built the world's industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.52,0:54:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, it is reinventing it for the age of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.36,0:54:10.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siemens is integrating NVIDIA CUDA X libraries AI models and Omniverse
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.96,0:54:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,into its portfolio of EDA CAE and digital twin tools and platforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.16,0:54:27.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together, we're bringing physical AI to the full industrial life cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.24,0:54:36.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,From design and simulation to production and operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.20,0:54:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We stand at the beginning of a new industrial revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.96,0:54:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The age of physical AI built by NVIDIA and Siemens for the next age of industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.48,0:54:54.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible, right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.44,0:54:55.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.92,0:54:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.31,0:54:56.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll hang on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.01,0:54:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just hang on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.16,0:55:08.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, so this is you know, if you look at look at the world's models there's no question OpenAI is the the leading token generator today.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.92,0:55:12.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,More to more OpenAI tokens are generated than just about anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.66,0:55:16.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second largest group the second largest probably open models.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.89,0:55:21.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And my guess is that over time, because there are so many companies, so many researchers,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.37,0:55:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,so many different types of domains and modalities that open source models will be by far the largest.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.56,0:55:29.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about somebody really special.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.68,0:55:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You guys want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.76,0:55:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about Vera Rubin.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.28,0:55:36.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin Yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.56,0:55:39.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,She's an American astronomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.60,0:55:50.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,She was the first to observe She noticed that the tails of the galaxies were moving about as fast as the center of the galaxies.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.08,0:55:52.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, I know it makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.52,0:55:53.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.58,0:55:56.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Newtonian physics would say, just like the solar system,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.95,0:56:04.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,the planets further away from the sun is circling the sun slower than the planets closer to the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.52,0:56:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And therefore, it makes no sense that this happens unless there's invisible bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.01,0:56:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,we call them she discovered dark body dark matter, um that occupies space even though we don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.93,0:56:25.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, Vera Rubin is the person that we named our next computer after.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.16,0:56:27.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.48,0:56:31.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.16,0:56:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.54,0:56:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is designed to address this fundamental challenge that we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.88,0:56:39.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The amount of computation necessary for AI is skyrocketing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.80,0:56:43.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,The demand for NVIDIA GPUs is skyrocketing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.47,0:56:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's skyrocketing because models are increasing by a factor of 10 an order of a magnitude every single year.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.52,0:56:56.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And not to mention, as I mentioned, 01's introduction was an inflection point for AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.92,0:57:03.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Instead of a one-shot answer, inference is now a thinking process.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.06,0:57:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in order to teach the AI how to think, reinforcement learning and very significant computation was introduced into post-training.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.60,0:57:21.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It wasn't no long It's no longer supervised fine-tuning or otherwise known as imitation learning or supervision training.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.24,0:57:29.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,You now have reinforcement learning, essentially the computer trial trying different iterations itself, learning how to perform a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.51,0:57:38.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,The amount of computation for pre pre-training, for post-training, for test time scaling has exploded as a result of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.39,0:57:45.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now every single inference that we do, instead of just one shot, the number of tokens you could just see the AIs think, which we appreciate.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.87,0:57:48.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,The longer it thinks, often times it produces a better answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.71,0:57:55.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, test time scaling causes the number of tokens to be generated increase by 5x every single year.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.64,0:58:01.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not to mention meanwhile, the race is on for AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.08,0:58:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody's trying to get to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.82,0:58:04.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody's trying to get to the next frontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.62,0:58:15.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,And every time they get to the next frontier the last generation AI tokens, the cost starts to starts to decline about a factor of 10x every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.39,0:58:18.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 10x decline every year is actually telling you something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.03,0:58:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's saying that the race is so intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.44,0:58:26.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody's trying to get to the next level and somebody is getting to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.66,0:58:29.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, therefore all of it is a computing problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.78,0:58:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The faster you compute, the sooner you can get to the next level of the next frontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.28,0:58:37.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of these things are simultaneously happening at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.78,0:58:46.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we decided that we have to advance the state of the art of computation every single year.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.10,0:58:48.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not one year left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.27,0:58:53.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, we've been shipping GB200s year and a half ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.77,0:58:58.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right now, we're in full-scale manufacturing of GB300.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.76,0:59:05.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if Vera Rubin is going to be in time for this year, it must be in production by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.77,0:59:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, today I can tell you that Vera Rubin is in full production.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.84,0:59:17.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You guys want to take a look at Vera Rubin?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.77,0:59:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,All right.
