Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.64,0:59:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Play it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.16,0:59:29.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin arrives just in time for the next frontier of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.76,0:59:32.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This This the story of how we built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.56,0:59:39.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The architecture, a system of six chips engineered to work as one, born from extreme co-design.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.60,0:59:45.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It begins with Vera, a custom-designed CPU, double the performance of the previous generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.44,0:59:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the Rubin GPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.88,0:59:56.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera and Rubin are co-designed from the start to bidirectionally and coherently share data faster and with lower latency.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.24,1:00:04.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then, 17,000 components come together on a Vera Rubin compute board.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.28,1:00:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,High-speed robots place components with micron precision before the Vera CPU and two Rubin GPUs complete the assembly.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.12,1:00:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Capable of delivering 100 petaflops of AI, five times that of its predecessor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.88,1:00:24.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI needs data fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.04,1:00:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,ConnectX-9 delivers 1.6 terabits per second of scale-out bandwidth to each GPU.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.64,1:00:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,BlueField-4 DPU offloads storage and security, so compute stays fully focused on AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.40,1:00:48.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Vera Rubin compute tray, completely redesigned with no cables, hoses, or fans.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.28,1:00:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Featuring a BlueField-4 DPU, eight ConnectX-9 NICs, two Vera CPUs, and four Rubin GPUs.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.48,1:01:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The compute building block of the Vera Rubin AI supercomputer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.20,1:01:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next, the sixth-generation NVLink switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.16,1:01:18.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Moving more data than the global internet, connecting 18 compute nodes, scaling up to 72 Rubin GPUs operating as one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.44,1:01:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then, Spectrum-X Ethernet photonics.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.16,1:01:30.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The world's first Ethernet switch with 512 lanes and 200 gigabit capable co-
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.08,1:01:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,packaged optics scale out thousands of racks into an AI factory.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.40,1:01:45.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,15,000 engineer years since design began, the first Vera Rubin NVL72 rack comes online.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.12,1:01:51.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Six breakthrough chips, 18 compute trays, nine NVLink switch trays,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.27,1:01:57.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,220 trillion transistors, weighing nearly two tons.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.04,1:02:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,One giant leap to the next frontier of AI.
