Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.40,1:02:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,First of all, we have a rule inside our company, and it's a good rule.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.24,1:02:53.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,No new generation should have more than one or two chips change.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.48,1:02:55.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, the problem is this.
