Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.40,1:03:34.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is impossible to keep up with those kind of rates for the industry to continue to advance unless we deployed aggressive,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.90,1:03:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,extreme co-design, basically innovating across all of the chips, across the entire stack, all at the same time.
